    "Grass → Grass/Dark.",
    "Broad spoon-shaped sticky sundew leaves, not a toothed Venus flytrap mouth or animal costume.",
    "Three big curled leaves grow into six interlocking leaf arms; use a few large sticky bulb tips instead of fine hairs.",
    "One central true face with clearly readable two eye whites and black pupils, plus one deceptive opening implied by curled leaf shapes."
